      "created_at": "2021-01-16T06:43:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Are there any formal rules in the game for players gaining a network of contacts, supporting cast or allies in play? or is this just assumed to happen anturally and the GM is assumed to apply this himself.</p>\n<p>Or is their some king of mechanical benefit to having a contact or ally available?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
